, providing soft hydration and helping maintain a mildly acidic environment.\nTrace Fragrance: Aromatic ingredients that create different scent profiles and help neutralize unwanted odors (the source of variation across the 8 scents)."}]}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","article","dosing",{"id":"dosing","className":"content-panel","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-title","children":["$","span",null,{"children":"Dosing & Protocol"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"panel-body","children":[["$","$4","0",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Instructions for Use"}],null,[["$","p","0",{"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"1.Clean hands thoroughly\n2.Put on the disposable finger cot\n3.Take out lyophilized ball, gently insert deep into vagina"}]}],["$","p","1",{"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"Note：The ball will gradually dissolve and release nutrients under intimate environment."}]}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","$4","1",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Usage Frequency"}],null,[["$","p","0",{"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"Daily maintenance: 2-3 times per week\nDry & sensitive period: once per night, 7 days as one care cycle"}]}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","article","coa",{"id":"coa","className":"content-panel","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-title","children":["$","span",null,{"children":"COA & Testing"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"panel-body","children":[["$","$4","0",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Certificate of Analysis"}],null,[["$","p","0",{"children":["$","span",null,{"children":"Each LPPeptide lot should be confirmed against current batch documentation before shipment or study use. This product page keeps VP-1 visible so the SKU can be matched to the active COA."}]}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]],["$","article",null,{"id":"reviews","className":"content-panel reviews-panel","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-title","children":["$","span",null,{"children":"Avaliações - 26"}]}],["$","di